# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT
#   Where the contact form POSTs. Optional — and the site works either way.
#
#   UNSET  the form does not pretend to send. It opens the visitor's own mail
#          client with a pre-filled message to navarro.frames@gmail.com, and
#          says so plainly on the form itself.
#
#   SET    the form POSTs JSON — {"name": "...", "email": "...", "message": "..."}
#          with `Accept: application/json`. Any 2xx response counts as
#          delivered; anything else shows a plain-English error and offers the
#          mail fallback. Requests time out after 15 seconds.
#
#   Where to get one:
#
#   Formspree — https://formspree.io — create a form, copy the endpoint:
#       VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
#
#   Web3Forms — https://web3forms.com — free, no account, emails you an access
#   key. Needs the second variable below:
#       VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#       VITE_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
#
#   Anything that accepts a JSON POST works: a Cloudflare Worker, a Netlify
#   function, a Vercel route.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY
#   Optional. Only Web3Forms needs it. When set it is added to the JSON body as
#   `access_key`; when unset the body stays exactly {name, email, message}.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WARNING: every VITE_-prefixed variable is inlined into the public JavaScript
# bundle and is readable by anyone who opens the site. Put nothing secret here
# — no mail passwords, no private API keys. A Web3Forms access key and a
# Formspree endpoint are both designed to be public; a mail server password is
# not, and belongs behind a serverless function instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
VITE_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY=
